meta {
  name: Get Usulan Statistics
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/admin/usulan/statistics
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~tahun: 2025
}

docs {
  # GET /api/admin/usulan/statistics
  
  Mengambil statistik usulan untuk dashboard admin.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | tahun | string | Filter tahun (opsional) |
  
  ## Response Success (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Statistik usulan berhasil diambil",
    "data": {
      "total": 50,
      "byStatus": {
        "Draft": 10,
        "Pending": 20,
        "Approved": 15,
        "Declined": 5
      },
      "byTipe": {
        "Penelitian": 30,
        "Pengabdian": 20
      }
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Use Cases
  - Dashboard cards showing total usulan
  - Pie chart distribution by status
  - Bar chart comparison Penelitian vs Pengabdian
}
